# Archived OpenSpec changes — historical artifacts, not reviewed line-by-line.
# Collapse them in code-review diffs and suppress their body in local git.
#
#   gitlab-generated     → GitLab collapses the file in MR diffs (still Expand-able).
#                          This is the one that matters here — we review on GitLab.
#   linguist-generated   → same effect for GitHub PR diffs; GitLab ignores it
#                          (kept only for a potential GitHub mirror).
#   -diff                → native git: `git diff` / `git log -p` mark the file as
#                          changed but omit its body. Local-only, host-agnostic.
openspec/changes/archive/** gitlab-generated
openspec/changes/archive/** linguist-generated=true
openspec/changes/archive/** -diff

